# Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon token (free, cookieless — see README "Analytics" section).
# The real token is already committed as a default in BaseLayout.astro (it's not a secret —
# it's visible in every page's HTML source once deployed). Only set this to override it,
# e.g. to point a preview/staging build at a different Cloudflare property.
PUBLIC_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=
